# Issue Packet Template (Fix / Optimization)

> **Use for**: Fix (observed `kind:"error"`) or Optimization (success violates acceptance check)
> **Required**: All sections. Incomplete = `EVIDENCE_GAP` → retest or stop.

---

## Issue Type

- [ ] **Fix** — Observed `kind:"error"` envelope
- [ ] **Optimization** — Successful run violates declared acceptance check

