## Executable Identity (Binary Admission — REQUIRED)

| Field | Value | Source |
|-------|-------|--------|
| Canonical path | `{{CANONICAL_PATH}}` | `which g8s` |
| SHA-256 digest | `{{SHA256}}` | `sha256sum bin/g8s` |
| Self-reported version | `{{VERSION_JSON}}` | `g8s version --json` |
| Immutable provenance | `{{PROVENANCE}}` | Git commit from version |
| Safe capability evidence | `{{DOCTOR_JSON}}` | `g8s doctor --json` |
| Regression result | `{{REGRESSION}}` | `g8s cleanup --dry-run` + `g8s status --worker --json` |

